XPics is an amazing image processing software. Functions include: long picture stitching, batch cropping pictures, filter, nine-square grid, split picture, blank, two-dimensional code production, whiteboard, private photo album, holiday avatar and other functions.

【Features】
- Support iPhone & iPad;
- [Long image stitching] 24 original images stitching, original image quality output, support horizontal and vertical directions, one-key automatic stitching;
- [Picture batch cropping] Batch cropping pictures, custom cropping area, movable and stretchable cropping area;
- 【Nine Palaces】Mix multiple pictures into one picture in grid form;
- 【Blank】Leave a blank for the picture;
- [Filters] 14 carefully selected high-quality filters;
- [Picture] Cut a picture into multiple pictures in equal proportions;
- [Free Puzzle] Freely splice multiple pictures;
- [Timeline] Multiple pictures are combined into a story wall;
- [Two-dimensional code creation] Generate text into two-dimensional code pictures;
- [Whiteboard] Picture graffiti;
- 【Privacy Album】Store private photos and videos;

Produced by the author of JPics, original image quality output; no ads, no in-app purchases;
